<title>AUSTRALIA: Ci Technologies lists at 37 pct premium.</title>
<headline>Ci Technologies lists at 37 pct premium.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in automation software group Ci Technologies Group ltd made their debut on the Australian Stock Exchange on Thursday at A$2.05, a 37 percent premium to their issue price of A$1.50.  </p>
<p>By 11.40 a.m. (0140 GMT), Ci shares were trading at A$2.12, after touching a high of A$2.15, on turnover of 601,540 shares.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
